<title>GREECE: ABN-AMRO'S KOKKINIAS TO HEAD INSTITUTIONALS SALES DESK.</title>
<headline>ABN-AMRO'S KOKKINIAS TO HEAD INSTITUTIONALS SALES DESK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Kokkinias, chief forex dealer at ABN-AMRO bank, Athens has been promoted to head of the bank's institutional sales desk, its treasurer told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;John Kokkinias has been promoted and will head the institutional sales desk,&quot; Richard Bruens, treasurer of ABN-AMRO bank told Reuters. &quot;ABN-AMRO is expanding its sales force.&quot; --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
